  {
    "question": "请用一个生活中的简单例子解释变量赋值和数学等式的区别。",
    "seconds": 9.765,
    "turn": {
      "turn_id": "answer-8aa5bec465314c1aba103967561d725b",
      "session_id": "learning-b7e3703e5cbe795d946b303899ea561e04e3a0a8e2f83ec1ddeefdbdf4156bd1",
      "request_id": "2307986b-a8c5-4d51-a6cc-fb18a6367f3f",
      "topic_id": "a",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "stage": "succeeded",
      "attempt": 1,
      "result": {
        "actions": [],
        "citations": [
          {
            "title": "Python变量与赋值",
            "locator": null,
            "visibility": "course",
            "citation_id": "ctx_01",
            "content_hash": "9cba80175b57cf3831fc25eb07774ec5194614a80b386d3aafdb87ea2cdba60a",
            "resource_ref": {
              "version": 2,
              "course_id": "learning-fixture",
              "material_id": "a-core",
              "material_type": "report"
            }
          }
        ],
        "observation": null,
        "citation_ids": [
          "ctx_01"
        ],
        "memory_epoch": 0,
        "model_rounds": 1,
        "role_version": "learning-role-v1",
        "tool_attempts": 0,
        "answer_markdown": "用「贴标签」来理解：\n\n**变量赋值**：把一张标签贴到某个东西上，而且可以随时撕下来换贴到别处。\n\n- `x = 1`：把「x」这张标签贴在数字 1 上。\n- `x = 2`：把标签撕下来，改贴到数字 2 上。\n- `y = x`：再拿一张「y」标签，贴在 x 现在指着的那个东西（2）上。\n\n**数学等式**：像天平，两边必须永远相等，不能「重新贴」。\n\n- 数学里 `x = 1` 表示 x 就是 1，之后不能再变成 2，否则就矛盾了。\n\n所以关键区别是：程序里的 `=` 是「把名字指向某个值」的动作，可以反复改；数学里的 `=` 是「两边相等」的陈述，是固定不变的关系。",
        "source_revision": 0,
        "preparation_receipts": [],
        "suggested_action_ids": []
      },
      "error_code": null,
      "committed_effects": []
    }
  },
  {
    "question": "x = 1; y = x; x = 2。不要直接给答案，只给一步提示引导我判断 y 的值。",
    "seconds": 4.236,
    "turn": {
      "turn_id": "answer-32e257731cf741ae8a07d4bd63aea27d",
      "session_id": "learning-b7e3703e5cbe795d946b303899ea561e04e3a0a8e2f83ec1ddeefdbdf4156bd1",
      "request_id": "3380a6b7-def9-4a72-a1ea-a3a4fc3c1fff",
      "topic_id": "a",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "stage": "succeeded",
      "attempt": 1,
      "result": {
        "actions": [],
        "citations": [
          {
            "title": "Python变量与赋值",
            "locator": null,
            "visibility": "course",
            "citation_id": "ctx_01",
            "content_hash": "9cba80175b57cf3831fc25eb07774ec5194614a80b386d3aafdb87ea2cdba60a",
            "resource_ref": {
              "version": 2,
              "course_id": "learning-fixture",
              "material_id": "a-core",
              "material_type": "report"
            }
          }
        ],
        "observation": null,
        "citation_ids": [
          "ctx_01"
        ],
        "memory_epoch": 0,
        "model_rounds": 1,
        "role_version": "learning-role-v1",
        "tool_attempts": 0,
        "answer_markdown": "先想清楚 `y = x` 这一步发生时，x 指向的是哪个值？\n\n提示：`y = x` 是「让 y 引用 x 当时绑定的对象」，而不是「让 y 永远跟着 x 变」。所以关键看执行到 `y = x` 那一行时，x 还是 1 还是已经变成 2 了。",
        "source_revision": 1,
        "preparation_receipts": [],
        "suggested_action_ids": []
      },
      "error_code": null,
      "committed_effects": []
    }
  },
